  {
    "sha": "c9c66c0c72a82fa1d87760f07d44271ecf34bc57",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOVoU8JdoAKGM5YzY2YzBjNzJhODJmYTFkODc3NjBmMDdkNDQyNzFlY2YzNGJjNTc",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "mkinney",
        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-20T16:04:52Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "mkinney",
        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-20T16:04:52Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(import): read the STEP short name of the plane angle unit\n\nThe pinned p21 parser leaves PLANUN (PLANE_ANGLE_UNIT) and GC\n(GLOBAL_UNCERTAINTY_ASSIGNED_CONTEXT) short. The unit reader then did not\nsee a degree angle unit and read each angle in radians. A cone with a\n1 degree semi-angle was read as 1 radian.\n\nExpand both names with the GUAC and SUNT names of #2919, in one table.\nRefuse a file by name when a plane angle unit cannot be converted to\nradians, or when a unit measures a plane angle but is not marked as one.\n\nAdd our 1 degree draft frustum fixture with short-name units. Give the\nSTEP agreement bench a NotRecorded truck side for fixtures added after\nthe truck reader left (#2790).\n\nFixes #2973\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "3b1fd8bc7b4f4ea45b7ed9fef5232c16ce3ea2a6",
